Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4ae95fdf-c5c4-3ac8-b86c-a6a568d161b1.xml</text>
